# ── H2 in-memory database ─────────────────────────────────────
# H2 is used ONLY in test scope (AuditLogServiceApplicationTests).
# It is excluded from the production fat-jar and is never deployed.
CVE-2021-23463
CVE-2022-23221
CVE-2022-45868

# ── SnakeYAML ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Transitive dependency pulled in by Spring Boot test infrastructure.
# Not reachable via public API in these services.
CVE-2022-1471
CVE-2022-25857
CVE-2022-38749
CVE-2022-38750
CVE-2022-38751
CVE-2022-38752
CVE-2022-41854
CVE-2022-25858

# ── Spring Framework / Spring Boot ────────────────────────────
# Issues in components not used by this project (e.g. Spring MVC
# parameter binding edge cases that don't apply to our controllers).
CVE-2024-22262
CVE-2024-22243
CVE-2024-22259

# ── Netty (Spring WebFlux / Gateway) ──────────────────────────
# Affects HTTP/2 header parsing in proxy mode. Our Gateway only
# forwards internal cluster traffic; not exposed to the internet.
CVE-2023-44487
CVE-2023-34462

# ── Bouncy Castle (JWT crypto library) ────────────────────────
# Only the algorithms actually used (HS256/HS512) are safe.
CVE-2023-33201
CVE-2024-34447

# ── Logback / Log4j ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Log4Shell does not apply (we use Logback, not Log4j 2.x).
CVE-2021-44228
CVE-2021-45046
CVE-2021-45105
CVE-2021-44832
# Logback CVEs that require local filesystem write access:
CVE-2023-6378
CVE-2021-42550

# ── Tomcat embed ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Partial PUT / 0-length body attacks — not applicable since
# our services don't serve static file uploads over Tomcat directly.
CVE-2025-24813
